Caveats: 
  * The cluster is small (depth-2 BFS); dimension fits are 
    indicative, not precise.  For publication-quality numbers 
    one wants thousands of cells and KPM-based DOS analysis. 
  * The tau_rule used here (vortex on every 3rd edge) is a 
    didactic choice; replacing it with the cut-and-project 
    window of idea.md Section 2.4 yields the rigorous regime. 
  * Same-orientation tiling is geometrically frustrated; this 
    experiment lets the sheet index absorb the angular deficit, 
    consistent with the multi-sheeted construction. 
